{
  "_README": [
    "Bonuses that are not stat blocks: conversions and conditional effects.",
    "",
    "These cannot be mined - they live in ability configs under BinOutput,",
    "not in a table. So every rule cites the in-game wording it came from,",
    "and the loader checks that the numbers it claims actually appear in",
    "that wording. A rule that says 25% against text that says 20% will not",
    "load. That check is the reason this file is allowed to exist as",
    "hand-written data at all.",
    "",
    "Anything depending on how you play - stacks, uptime, whether a buff is",
    "up - reads a condition you declare on the goal. Mimir asks rather than",
    "assumes: whether your Marechaussee sits at three stacks is a fact about",
    "your rotation, not about the set."
  ],

